Hi.

I've ported successfully my application from fusion to xenomai, I've also
removed many parts of vxworks skins, everything excepts the semaphores

Now I have some problem with my task, but I cannot explain it completely
without an example, so I write this test application, that it's in fact all
my Real Time needing.

As explained in my last post there is two task: "tPlc" is an High priority
task, and "tService"

In service there is a
for(i=0;i<=1000;i++)    appo*=1.01;
 to test that the "tPlc" task run every 5 milliseconds, also if service
hasn't finished it's work.

this line is now commented because it causes deadlock with the increasing of
the cycle's numbers.

could you please help me? I can't find any conceptual errors in this code

thanks, Racconico

